<title>JAPAN: Japan offers 1.2 trln yen three-month T-bills.</title>
<headline>Japan offers 1.2 trln yen three-month T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on Wednesday it would offer 1.2 trillion yen worth of three-month Treasury Bills through a price competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at 0300 GMT and the results will be announced at 0530 GMT.</p>
<p>The issue date will be October 21 and maturity date will be January 20, 1997.</p>
</text>
